```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>State Bar</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .state-bar-container {
            background-color: #2c2a24;
            border: 1px solid #8c7a5b;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            max-width: 400px;
            margin: auto;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .section {
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #5c4a3b;
        }
        .section:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #f0e6d2;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #8c7a5b;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
            gap: 4px 10px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .info-grid .label {
            font-weight: 300;
            color: #a09078;
        }
        .info-grid .value {
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #dcdcdc;
        }
        .description {
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #b0a088;
            margin-top: 5px;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .branches {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        .branch-link {
            background-color: #4a4130;
            color: #f0e6d2;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            border: 1px solid #6a5a40;
        }
        .player-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: baseline;
        }
        .player-name {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 1.5em;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffd700;
        }
        .player-level-class {
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #c0c0c0;
        }
        .details-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 8px 0 0 0;
        }
        .details-list li {
            background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            padding: 5px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
        .details-list .label {
            color: #a09078;
            margin-right: 5px;
        }
        .currency-bar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            background-color: #1f1d19;
        }
        .currency-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .coin {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .gold { background-color: #ffd700; color: #4d3800; }
        .silver { background-color: #c0c0c0; color: #333; }
        .bronze { background-color: #cd7f32; color: #3b1e00; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="state-bar-container">
        <div class="section">
            <div class="info-grid">
                <span class="label">时间:</span><span class="value">$1</span>
                <span class="label">季节:</span><span class="value">$2</span>
                <span class="label">场景:</span><span class="value">$3</span>
            </div>
            <p class="description">"$4"</p>
            <div class="branches">
                <span class="branch-link">→ $5</span>
                <span class="branch-link">→ $6</span>
            </div>
            <div class="info-grid" style="margin-top: 8px;">
                <span class="label">NPC($7):</span><span class="value">$8</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="player-header">
                <span class="player-name">$9</span>
                <span class="player-level-class">Lv.$10 $11</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="details-list">
                <li><span class="label">属性:</span>$13</li>
                <li><span class="label">技能:</span>$12</li>
                <li><span class="label">装备:</span>$14</li>
                <li><span class="label">背包:</span>$15</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="currency-bar">
            <div class="currency-item gold"><span class="coin gold"></span>$16</div>
            <div class="currency-item silver"><span class="coin silver"></span>$17</div>
            <div class="currency-item bronze"><span class="coin bronze"></span>$18</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```

